<section>
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2 class="section-title">Guiding principles</h2>
		<ul class="principles-list">
			<li>Target specific needs and pages instead of generic, global changes.</li>
			<li>Respect the host application's styles without polluting its CSS.</li>
			<li>Offer opt-in features through a side panel, not automatic changes.</li>
			<li>Assist but do not override: fill forms to save time, never auto-submit.</li>
			<li>Stay lightweight and rely on existing backend APIs for complex logic.</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
